      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُصَعَّدٌ</span></b>  A <i>high</i> mountain. (L.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَكَبٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُصَعَّدٌ</span>, or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُصَعِّدٌ</span></b> , <i>A high,</i> or <i>prominent, pubes.</i>
(L.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also Beverage, or wine, (K,) and vinegar,
(TA,) <i>prepared with pains by means of fire,</i> or
<i>well boiled,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُولِجَ بِالنَّارِ</span>, K, TA,) <i>until it becomes
altered in flavour and colour.</i> (TA.)

